      },
      "writtenOn": "2013-10-08T01:39:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "the usual convention is EC code is to define a CPRINTF macro in each module,\ne.g\n#define CPRINTF(format, args...) cprintf(CC_TASK, format, ## args)\n[...]\nCPRINTF(\"[%T low power idle task started]\\n\");",
      "revId": "83fc1988fba0e1c41be7a2dda5ff155946f38676",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
