      },
      "writtenOn": "2013-10-08T01:39:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think that\u0027s not entirely true (even if that was in the old code) and this interrupt disable is more or less no needed :\nsystem_get_rtc doesn\u0027t need interrupts to be disabled to get a correct timestamp,\nand then you account for the original delay you were asked for.",
      "revId": "83fc1988fba0e1c41be7a2dda5ff155946f38676",
